{"book":"hono","chapter":"middleware-builtin","chapterTitle":"الوسائط المدمجة","slug":"method-override","title":"وسيط تجاوز الطريقة (Method Override)","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":2,"id":"على-سبيل-المثال","text":"على سبيل المثال"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"app-hono","text":"app: Hono"},{"depth":3,"id":"form-string","text":"form: string"},{"depth":3,"id":"header-boolean","text":"header: boolean"},{"depth":3,"id":"query-boolean","text":"query: boolean"}],"html":"<p>ينفذ هذا الوسيط معالج الطريقة المحددة، التي تختلف عن الطريقة الفعلية للطلب، اعتمادًا على قيمة النموذج (form) أو الترويسة أو الاستعلام (query)، ويُرجع استجابته.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { methodOverride } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/method-override&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// If no options are specified, the value of `_method` in the form,</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// e.g. DELETE, is used as the method.</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">methodOverride</span>({ app }))\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">delete</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ....</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"على-سبيل-المثال\">على سبيل المثال</h2>\n<p>نظرًا لأن نماذج HTML لا يمكنها إرسال طريقة DELETE، يمكنك وضع القيمة <code>DELETE</code> في الخاصية المسماة <code>_method</code> وأرسله. والمعالج الخاص بـ <code>app.delete()</code> سيتم تنفيذها.</p>\n<p>نموذج <code>HTML</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">action</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/posts&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;POST&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;_method&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;DELETE&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>التطبيق:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { methodOverride } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/method-override&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">methodOverride</span>({ app }))\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">delete</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنك تغيير القيم الافتراضية أو استخدام قيمة الرأس (header) وقيمة الاستعلام (query):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">methodOverride</span>({ app, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">form</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;_custom_name&#x27;</span> }))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">methodOverride</span>({ app, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">header</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-METHOD-OVERRIDE&#x27;</span> })\n)\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">methodOverride</span>({ app, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">query</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;_method&#x27;</span> }))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h2>\n<h3 id=\"app-hono\"><Badge type=\"danger\" text=\"required\" /> app: <code>Hono</code></h3>\n<p>نسخة من <code>Hono</code> مستخدم في تطبيقك.</p>\n<h3 id=\"form-string\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> form: <code>string</code></h3>\n<p>مفتاح النموذج بقيمة تحتوي على اسم الطريقة.\nالقيمة الافتراضية هي <code>_method</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"header-boolean\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> header: <code>boolean</code></h3>\n<p>اسم ترويسة بقيمة تحتوي على اسم الطريقة.</p>\n<h3 id=\"query-boolean\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> query: <code>boolean</code></h3>\n<p>مفتاح معامل الاستعلام (query parameter) بقيمة تحتوي على اسم الطريقة.</p>\n"}